<title>COTE D'IVOIRE: Ivory Coast coffee bean shipments down in July.</title>
<headline>Ivory Coast coffee bean shipments down in July.</headline>
<dateline>ABIDJAN 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ivory Coast exported 10,184 tonnes of robusta coffee beans in July against 15,970 tonnes in June, official data show.</p>
<p>Exports in July 1995 amounted to 7,143 tonnes.</p>
<p>Cumulative exports in the first 10 months of the 1995/96 (Oct-Sept) season were 124,262 tonnes against 97,960 tonnes in the same period of 1994/95.</p>
<p>The data showed Abidjan, the main port, handled 9,047 tonnes of last month's shipments and 1,137 tonnes left via San Pedro.</p>
<p>--David Gault, Abidjan Newsroom +225 21 90 90</p>
</text>
